<title>AUSTRIA: VA Tech posts strong set of 1996 earnings.</title>
<headline>VA Tech posts strong set of 1996 earnings.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Group earnings for the year ending December 31, 1996. (Figures in millions of schillings unless stated)</p>
<p>						  1996	  1995</p>
<p> Order intake				44,576	35,262</p>
<p> Order backlog (as at Dec 31)	  80,444	66,349</p>
<p> Turnover				    33,537	26,085</p>
<p> Turnover plus changes in inventory  37,935	30,927</p>
<p> Pretax profit				1,672	 1,270</p>
<p> Net profit				   1,404	 1,339</p>
<p> Product and process innovation	 1,169	 1,102</p>
<p> Cash flow				    2,086	 1,719</p>
<p> Investments in tangible and	    1,002	   660</p>
<p>intangible assets</p>
<p> Investments in shareholdings	     405	 1,667</p>
<p> Employees				   16,665	15,683</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12256</p>
